  "description": "A SQL Server traffic proxy that gives you control, visibility, and auditing over database connections without changing the application or SQL Server. Clients connect to DaffyTee as if it were SQL Server; each session is relayed to a real instance under a per-user mapped login, and every request (SQL, parameters, user, timing, rows, errors) is streamed asynchronously to RabbitMQ or a file - for troubleshooting, performance analysis, security investigations, compliance and migration planning - without slowing the database path. Passwords are never logged. Early release.",
